cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Python OpenCV Utilities"
abstract: >-
  Python OpenCV Utilities (cv2u) is a drop-in replacement for the OpenCV
  Python module (import cv2u as cv). It keeps every OpenCV function and its
  type information, and adds utilities such as crop-free image rotation,
  DBSCAN color clustering, gamma correction, edge enhancement, gradient
  images, point-in-polygon tests and Unicode (e.g. Korean) text rendering
  with TrueType fonts.
